  "name": "bark-server",
  "category": "other",
  "description": "Bark Server 是 iOS 端 Bark 推送应用的自建后端，通过 HTTP 接收消息并经由 APNS 推送到 iPhone，轻量易部署。",
  "version": "latest",
  "logo": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Finb/bark-server/master/README/bark.png",
  "website": "https://github.com/Finb/bark-server",
  "tutorial": "访问地址：http://服务器IP:8080\n数据（设备 token）在 ./data。\niOS 推送需服务器可被公网以 HTTPS 访问（APNS 回调）。\n需自行配置 APNS Key。",
  "dotenv": "",
  "compose": "services:\n  bark-server:\n    image: finab/bark-server\n    restart: always\n    ports:\n      - \"8080:8080\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./data:/data",
